        <!-- Closing -->
        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Ryobi and Greenworks electric pressure washers deliver nearly identical real cleaning power at the same price points, once you compare flow at full pressure rather than at 100 PSI. Greenworks wins on motor warranty, cordless power and retail choice; Ryobi wins on Home Depot convenience and for anyone already invested in its 40V batteries.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Whichever brand you choose, buy a brushless model, match the surface cleaner to the flow, and check any used Ryobi brushless machine against the 2025 recall. Our ranked picks are in the best electric pressure washers guide.
          </p>
